Cell["\<\
Note that these quantities are taken from the initial conditions . But we are \
using them to compute a quantity once the cluster is actually collapsed \
(which may be Gyr later, where the quantities such as mean mass .. total \
cluster mass.. change slightly). So we should be careful.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98710397914439*^9, 3.987104084366026*^9}, {
  3.987104114450116*^9, 3.987104118741494*^9}, {3.987104553345872*^9, 
