Cell["\<\
Note: Flag 15 for the eccentricity: we draw from a super thermal \
distribution. Something optional to be confirmed(?) by rebound is any \
correlation between the post-interaction e and a.

Also note that currently, we don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t change the black hole sub \
cluster half mass radius rhBH according to ejections.\
\>", "Text",
